							</p>

							<p>
								<strong>Last Updated:</strong> 4 Aug 2026
							</p>

							<p>
								Welcome to Leichil TV! These Terms and
								Conditions ("Terms") govern your access to
								and use of our website, mobile applications,
								Smart TV applications, and streaming services
								(collectively, the "Service"), operated by
