									You must be at least 18 years of age to
									create an account and purchase a
									subscription. Individuals under this age
									may only use the Service under the
									supervision of a parent or legal guardian.

								</li>

								<li>

									<strong>
										Account Security:
									</strong>

									You are responsible for maintaining the
