									or implied.

								</li>

								<li>

									<strong>
										Limitation of Damages:
									</strong>

									Iron Blade Innovation Labs Private Ltd.
									and its affiliates, directors, or
									licensors shall not be liable for any
									indirect, incidental, special, or
