						</div>

						<div
							class="privacy-card"
							id="contact">

							<h2>
								10. Contact Us
							</h2>

							<p>

								For questions regarding these Terms and
								Conditions, please contact us at:

							</p>

							<ul>

								<li>

									<strong>
										Company Name:
									</strong>

									Iron Blade Innovation Labs Private Ltd.

								</li>

								<li>

									<strong>
										Support Email:
									</strong>

									contact@ironbladelabs.com

								</li>

								<li>

									<strong>
										Address:
									</strong>

									Nahabam, Bamon Leikai

								</li>

							</ul>

